title: The button at the top hides and shows the files; a click on an icon opens it and the same click closes it; an icon goes to the top of the main bar and opens in its panel, then to the other bar, whose panel is off, and floats as a card
expect-file: {WORK}\data\session.json :: "right": \[[^\]]*"deps"
expect-file: {WORK}\data\session.json :: "cards": \[[^\]]*"deps"
folders: git-changes
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
mark a-start
wait 400
ui click 65 20
wait 600
mark b-files-hidden-by-the-button
wait 400
ui click 65 20
wait 600
mark c-files-back
wait 400
ui click 26 98
wait 700
mark d-search-by-a-click-on-its-icon
wait 400
ui click 26 98
wait 600
mark e-closed-by-the-same-click
wait 400
move deps left files
wait 800
mark f-deps-first-on-the-bar
wait 400
right deps
wait 700
mark g-deps-in-the-main-panel
wait 400
move deps right
wait 800
mark h-deps-icon-on-the-other-bar-floats-as-a-card
wait 400
quit
